Mother, Red Hood and Grandmother kept living in the forest. Wolf, after he drank the potion, turned into a badger. It was clearly written to strictly follow the dosage! We have to admit it served him right because meeting such a nice animal girls didn't ran away in horror as it used to be, but gladly spoke to him. Soon former wolf recommenced attempts with an antidote and asked one pretty traveler for help. This time he personally watched the process of mixing and when he made sure there was no mistake, drank the potion.
Now instead of fluffy animal there was a young handsome man in front of the girl, he was a prince by the way. Without thinking twice youngsters got married and lived happily ever after.
